{"candidateAnswer":"Around the end of 2022","evidence":"[D3:1 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: Hey Maria, great to chat again! I joined a service-focused online group last week and it's been an emotional ride. Everyone there is incredible with their own inspiring stories. They've opened my eyes to new perspectives, and I'm feeling a sense of connection and purpose with them.","itemId":"urn:uuid:05f2d12c-d851-5aa2-944a-c7df873dc349","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:29e0926be9f4441fcc180942862447c366ea82111db80e247b3fa828b26f1dc8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John join the online support group?","referenceAnswer":"The week before 1 January 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"29e0926be9f4441fcc180942862447c366ea82111db80e247b3fa828b26f1dc8"}}]}